# Cloudflare Pages format: [source] [destination] [code]. Lines starting with #
# are comments.
#
# There must be no /pools/* rule here: Pages evaluates redirects before static
# assets, so a catch-all would shadow every archived pool page that
# render_static_site writes under /pools/<slug>/.
#
# /submit/ is season-only (no server to accept a submission during the
# offseason), so send it to the index rather than 404ing an indexed URL. Both
# forms are listed so this doesn't depend on the splat matching an empty segment.
/submit  /  302
/submit/*  /  302
